data: {"id":"gen-1793944160-GSOQlE6T6bOgp4sVRfMH","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944160,"model":"google/gemini-4-argon","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://exa.ai/library/weather/lisbon-portugal?latitude=38.7500&longitude=-9.1250&date=2026-11-07","title":"Lisbon, Portugal Weather | Slight rain showers, High 72°F","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"# Weather for Lisbon, Portugal - Saturday, November 7, 2026\n\nSlight rain showers. High 72°F (22°C), low 61°F (16°C). 0.7mm precipitation expected.\n\n- Conditions: Slight rain showers\n- High: 72°F (22°C) / Low: 61°F (16°C)\n- Precipitation: 0.7mm\n- UV Index: 3.3\n- Sunrise: 7:10 AM / Sunset: 5:30 PM\n\n## Hourly Forecast\n| Time | Temp | Conditions | Wind | Precip | Rain % |\n|:-----|-----:|:-----------|-----:|-------:|-------:|\n| 12:00 AM | 63°F | Overcast | 1 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 1:00 AM | 63°F | Partly cloudy | 1 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 2:00 AM | 63°F | Partly cloudy | 2 mph | 0.1mm | – |\n| 3:00 AM | 62°F | Partly cloudy | 1 mph | 0.1mm | – |\n| 4:00 AM | 61°F | Overcast | 2 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 5:00 AM | 61°F | Overcast | 3 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 6:00 AM | 61°F | Overcast | 3 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 7:00 AM | 61°F | Overcast | 3 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 8:00 AM | 61°F | Overcast | 3 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 9:00 AM | 62°F | Slight rain showers | 3 mph | 0.2mm | – |\n| 10:00 AM | 63°F | Slight rain showers | 3 mph | 0.3mm | – |\n| 11:00 AM | 65°F | Overcast | 2 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 12:00 PM | 67°F | Overcast | 3 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 1:00 PM | 70°F | Overcast | 4 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 2:00 PM | 72°F | Overcast | 6 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 3:00 PM | 72°F | Overcast | 6 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 4:00 PM | 71°F | Overcast | 4 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 5:00 PM | 70°F | Partly cloudy | 2 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 6:00 PM | 68°F | Overcast | 2 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 7:00 PM | 67°F | Overcast | 3 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 8:00 PM | 66°F | Partly cloudy | 0 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 9:00 PM | 65°F | Overcast | 2 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 10:00 PM | 65°F | Overcast | 3 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 11:00 PM | 65°F | Overcast | 4 mph | 0mm | – |\n\n## 15-Day Forecast\n| Day | Conditions | High | Low | Rain % | Precip | Wind |\n|:----|:-----------|-----:|----:|-------:|-------:|-----:|\n| Sat 7 | Slight rain showers | 72°F | 61°F | – | 0.7mm | 6 mph ESE |\n| Sun 8 | Slight rain showers | 69°F | 64°F | – | 5.6mm | 17 mph SSE |\n\n...\n\n## Source\nWeather data by Open-Meteo.com (https://open-meteo.com/), licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Open-Meteo blends forecast models from ECMWF, Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD), NOAA NCEP, the UK Met Office, the Japan Meteorological Agency and the Australian Bureau of Meteorology. Values are model output, not station observations. Units converted and values rounded by Exa."}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944160-GSOQlE6T6bOgp4sVRfMH","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944160,"model":"google/gemini-4-argon","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://satmeteo.com/weather/pt/2267057-lisbon/tomorrow","title":"Lisbon Weather Tomorrow – Hour-by-Hour Outlook | SatMeteo","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"# Tomorrow's Weather in Lisbon\n\n Lisbon \n\nPortugal\n\nTomorrow\n\nSaturday, 7 November\n\n Rain Showers AQI Good \n\n+22°C+71°F\n\nLow +16°C+60°F\n\n Min. +16°C+60°F Max. +22°C+71°F \n\n 7:10 AM 07:10 5:30 PM 17:30 \n\n- Wind 1.4 m/s 3 mph · East \n- Humidity 70% \n- UV 3 \n- Rain 90% \n- Pressure 1019 hPa 30.10 inHg \n- Dew point +14°C +57°F \n- Visibility 35.9 km 22.3 mi \n\n## Weather bulletin\n\nTomorrow Lisbon is expected to see Rain Showers with temperatures around 22°C, feeling like 22°C due to expected conditions. Rain is expected today, with 0.7 mm of precipitation forecasted. Heavy cloud cover at 95% is blocking most sunlight today. Humidity is at 69% and atmospheric pressure stands at 1018 hPa.\n\n## Day & night\n\n Day \n\n +22°C +71°F Overcast \n\nOvercast. High near 22°C. Winds light and variable. Chance of rain 83%. It feels like 19°C. Cloud cover around 96%.\n\n Rain 83% Wind 1.6 m/s 4 mph· Southeast Humidity 71% \n\n Night \n\n +16°C +60°F Overcast \n\nOvercast. Low around 16°C. Winds light and variable. Chance of rain 90%. It feels like 18°C. Cloud cover around 92%.\n\n Rain 90% Wind 1 m/s 2 mph· East Humidity 82% \n\n## Air quality\n\n Good\n\n...\n\n## 7-day outlook\n\n7-Day Weather Forecast ›\n\n...\n\n### Hourly Forecast for tomorrow\n\n| Time | | Temp | Feels | Rain | Precip | Wind | Hum. | Dew | UV |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 12:00 AM 00:00 | | +17°C +62°F | +18°C+65°F | 3% | 0 mm 0 in | 0.5 m/s 1 mph· Southeast | 90% | +15°C+59°F | — |\n| 1:00 AM 01:00 | | +17°C +62°F | +18°C+65°F | 5% | 0 mm 0 in | 0.3 m/s 1 mph· South | 89% | +15°C+59°F | — |\n| 2:00 AM 02:00 | | +17°C +62°F | +18°C+64°F | 3% | 0.1 mm 0.00 in | 0.9 m/s 2 mph· East | 91% | +15°C+59°F | — |\n| 3:00 AM 03:00 | | +16°C +61°F | +18°C+64°F | 3% | 0.1 mm 0.00 in | 0.6 m/s 1 mph· Northeast | 93% | +15°C+59°F | — |\n| 4:00 AM 04:00 | | +16°C +61°F | +17°C+63°F | 3% | 0 mm 0 in | 0.9 m/s 2 mph· Northeast | 93% | +15°C+58°F | — |\n| 5:00 AM 05:00 | | +16°C +60°F | +17°C+62°F | 3% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.3 m/s 3 mph· Northeast | 91% | +14°C+58°F | — |\n| 6:00 AM 06:00 | | +16°C +60°F | +17°C+62°F | 8% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.1 m/s 3 mph· Northeast | 89% | +14°C+57°F | — |\n| 7:00 AM 07:00 | | +16°C +60°F | +16°C+61°F | 10% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.4 m/s 3 mph· Northeast | 87% | +14°C+56°F | — |\n| 8:00 AM 08:00 | | +16°C +60°F | +16°C+61°F | 18% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.2 m/s 3 mph· Northeast | 88% | +14°C+57°F | — |\n| 9:00 AM 09:00 | | +16°C +61°F | +17°C+62°F | 28% | 0.2 mm 0.01 in | 1.3 m/s 3 mph· East | 87% | +14°C+57°F | — |\n| 10:00 AM 10:00 | | +17°C +62°F | +17°C+63°F | 35% | 0.3 mm 0.01 in | 1.3 m/s 3 mph· East | 85% | +14°C+58°F | — |\n| 11:00 AM 11:00 | | +18°C +64°F | +19°C+65°F | 45% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.1 m/s 2 mph· East | 78% | +14°C+57°F | — |\n| 12:00 PM 12:00 | | +19°C +67°F | +20°C+68°F | 58% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.4 m/s 3 mph· East | 70% | +14°C+57°F | — |\n| 1:00 PM 13:00 | | +21°C +69°F | +21°C+70°F | 63% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.9 m/s 4 mph· Southeast | 66% | +14°C+57°F | — |\n| 2:00 PM 14:00 | | +22°C +71°F | +22°C+71°F | 68% | 0 mm 0 in | 2.6 m/s 6 mph· South | 61% | +14°C+57°F | — |\n| 3:00 PM 15:00 | | +22°C +71°F | +21°C+70°F | 78% | 0 mm 0 in | 2.7 m/s 6 mph· Southeast | 55% | +12°C+54°F | — |\n| 4:00 PM 16:00 | | +21°C +70°F | +21°C+70°F | 83% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.9 m/s 4 mph· Southeast | 58% | +13°C+55°F | — |\n| 5:00 PM 17:00 | | +21°C +69°F | +21°C+70°F | 80% | 0 mm 0 in | 1 m/s 2 mph· South | 62% | +13°C+56°F | — |\n| 6:00 PM 18:00 | | +20°C +68°F | +20°C+69°F | 88% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.1 m/s 2 mph· South | 66% | +13°C+56°F | — |\n| 7:00 PM 19:00 | | +19°C +67°F | +19°C+67°F | 90% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.5 m/s 3 mph· Southwest | 67% | +13°C+55°F | — |\n| 8:00 PM 20:00 | | +19°C +66°F | +20°C+67°F | 85% | 0 mm 0 in | 0.1 m/s 0 mph· South | 70% | +13°C+56°F | — |\n| 9:00 PM 21:00 | | +18°C +65°F | +19°C+66°F | 85% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.1 m/s 2 mph· Southeast | 74% | +14°C+56°F | — |\n| 10:00 PM 22:00 | | +18°C +64°F | +19°C+65°F | 85% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.4 m/s 3 mph· East | 76% | +14°C+57°F | — |\n| 11:00 PM 23:00 | | +18°C +64°F | +18°C+64°F | 90% | 0 mm 0 in | 1.6 m/s 4 mph· East | 76% | +14°C+56°F | — |"}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944160-GSOQlE6T6bOgp4sVRfMH","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944160,"model":"google/gemini-4-argon","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://meteo.es/en/location/lisboa-pt/weekend-forecast","title":"Weekend weather in Lisboa | Friday to Sunday - Meteo.es","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"# Weekend weather in Lisboa \n\n Friday 6 November — Sunday 8 November · 45m \n\n## Weekend summary\n\nFriday\n\n6 Nov\n\n 21° 10° \n\nSlight rain showers\n\n 40% \n\nSaturday\n\n7 Nov\n\n 19° 16° \n\nThunderstorm\n\n 82% \n\nSunday\n\n8 Nov\n\n 20° 18° \n\nThunderstorm\n\n 90%\n\n...\n\n## Saturday\n\n7 de November\n\nThunderstorm 19° 16° \n\nFeels like 20° / 16° \n\nPrecipitation 82% (19.3 mm) \n\nWind 15 km/h SE\n\nGusts 37 km/h\n\nUV Index 2.8\n\nSunrise / Sunset 07:10 — 17:30 \n\nSun hours 0h\n\n### Hourly detail\n\n 00:00 17° 43% \n\n 01:00 17° 46% \n\n 02:00 17° 49% \n\n 03:00 17° 51% \n\n 04:00 16° 54% \n\n 05:00 16° 56% \n\n 06:00 16° 58% \n\n 07:00 16° 60% \n\n 08:00 16° 61% \n\n 09:00 16° 62% \n\n 10:00 17° 62% \n\n 11:00 17° 63% \n\n 12:00 18° 65% \n\n 13:00 18° 67% \n\n 14:00 19° 70% \n\n 15:00 19° 73% \n\n 16:00 19° 76% \n\n 17:00 19° 78% \n\n 18:00 19° 80% \n\n 19:00 19° 81% \n\n 20:00 18° 82% \n\n 21:00 18° 82% \n\n 22:00 18° 82% \n\n 23:00 18° 82% \n\n## Sunday\n\n8 de November\n\nThunderstorm 20° 18° \n\nFeels like 20° / 17° \n\nPrecipitation 90% (33.5 mm) \n\nWind 26 km/h SSE\n\nGusts 46 km/h\n\nUV Index 3.7\n\nSunrise / Sunset 07:11 — 17:29 \n\nSun hours 3.7h"}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944160-GSOQlE6T6bOgp4sVRfMH","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944160,"model":"google/gemini-4-argon","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://www.theportugalnews.com/news/2026-11-04/weekend-weather-forecast/1110909","title":"Weekend weather forecast - The Portugal News","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"# Weekend weather forecast\n\nRainy days are coming\n\n By TPN, in News · 04 Nov 2026, 15:03 · 0 Comments\n\n...\n\nLisbon: On Saturday, there is a chance of rain, with temperatures reaching 21 degrees and dropping to 16 degrees at night; however, there is also a chance of sunshine. On Sunday, the chance of showers increases, although temperatures may reach 22 degrees, with some sunshine remaining. From Monday, rain is set to continue, with cloud cover increasing."}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944160-GSOQlE6T6bOgp4sVRfMH","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944160,"model":"google/gemini-4-argon","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://www.portugal-news.today/en/article/344700","title":"Weather forecast for November 6, 2026 — Portugal news","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"# Weather forecast for November 6, 2026\n\nJornal de Mafra 5 November 2026 at 20:17\n\nThe weather forecast for November 6, 2026 covers the municipalities of Mafra, Ericeira, Sintra, Torres Vedras, Santa Cruz and Lisbon, with information for November 6 to 9. On Friday, November 6, rain or showers are expected in most locations, with minimum temperatures between 9º and 12º and maximum temperatures between 17º and 19º, and moderate southeast wind. In Lisbon, the wind will be light from the south. IPMA issued a yellow warning for the Lisbon district regarding precipitation, valid between 3:00 PM on the 6th and 12:00 AM on November 7th, warning of periods of rain or showers sometimes heavy and accompanied by thunderstorm. The warning was updated on November 5th at 7:23 PM. On Saturday, November 7th, the forecast indicates light rain or drizzle in Mafra and Lisbon, partly cloudy sky in Ericeira and Santa Cruz, and rain or light showers in Sintra and Torres Vedras, with temperatures rising to minimums between 14º and 17º and maximums between 19º and 21º, and predominantly moderate south or southwest wind. For Sunday, November 8th, rain or showers are forecast in Mafra, Sintra and Lisbon, light rain or drizzle in Torres Vedras, and rain or light showers in Ericeira and Santa Cruz, with temperatures ranging between 14º and 22º and moderate southeast wind in most locations. On Monday, November 9th, the trend is for continued rain or showers in all locations, with minimum temperatures between 15º and 17º and maximum temperatures between 20º and 22º, and moderate south or southwest wind.\n\n...\n\nThis is our short summary of a report published by Jornal de Mafra on 5 November 2026 at 20:17; the full text stays with the publisher."}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944160-GSOQlE6T6bOgp4sVRfMH","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944160,"model":"google/gemini-4-argon","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://nodejs.org/en/blog/release/v26.13.0","title":"Node.js — Node.js 26.13.0 (LTS)","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"Node.js — Node.js 26.13.0 (LTS)\n\n# Node.js 26.13.0 (LTS)\n\nRichard Lau\n\n## 2026-10-28, Version 26.13.0 'Lithium' (LTS), @richardlau\n\n### Notable Changes\n\nThis release marks the transition of Node.js 26.x into Long Term Support (LTS) with the codename 'Lithium'. It will continue to receive updates through to the end of April 2029.\n\nOther than updating metadata, such as the `process.release` object, to reflect that the release is LTS, no further changes from Node.js 26.12.1 are included.\n\n...\n\nPrevious Node.js 24.22.2 (LTS) Next Node.js 26.12.1 (Current)\n\nLast Updated\n: Oct 28, 2026"}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944160-GSOQlE6T6bOgp4sVRfMH","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944160,"model":"google/gemini-4-argon","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://nodejs.org/en","title":"Node.js","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"JavaScript Everywhere\n\n# Run JavaScript Everywhere\n\nNode.js® is a free, open-source, cross-platform JavaScript runtime environment that lets developers create servers, web apps, command line tools and scripts.\n\nNode."}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944160-GSOQlE6T6bOgp4sVRfMH","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944160,"model":"google/gemini-4-argon","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://nodejs.org/en/download/","title":"Node.js — Download Node.js®","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"Node.js — Download Node.js®\n\n# Download Node.js®\n\nGet Node.js® \n\nv26.13.0 LTS\n\nv26.13.0 LTS\n\nv27.0.0-alpha.0.0.0 Alpha\n\nv26.13.0 LTS\n\nv25.9.0 EOL\n\nv24.22.2 LTS\n\nv23.11.1 EOL\n\nv22.23.4 LTS\n\nv21.7.3 EOL\n\nv20.20.2 EOL\n\nv19.9.0 EOL"}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944160-GSOQlE6T6bOgp4sVRfMH","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944160,"model":"google/gemini-4-argon","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://nodejs.org/en/blog/release","title":"Node.js","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"The latest Node.js news, migration guides and events summaries\n\nReleases Node.js 27.0.0-alpha.0.0.0 (Alpha)\n\nRG\n\nRafael Gonzaga\n\nOct 29, 2026\n\nReleases Node.js 24.22.2 (LTS)\n\nADH\n\nAntoine du Hamel\n\nOct 28, 2026\n\nReleases Node.js 26.13.0 (LTS)\n\nRL\n\nRichard Lau\n\nOct 28, 2026\n\nReleases Node.js 26.12.1 (Current)\n\nADH\n\nAntoine du Hamel\n\nOct 21, 2026\n\nReleases Node.js 24.22.1 (LTS)\n\nADH\n\nAntoine du Hamel\n\nOct 21, 2026\n\nReleases Node.js 22.23.4 (LTS)\n\nAntoine du Hamel\n\nOct 21, 2026\n\nv26.13.0 Latest LTS v27.0.0-alpha.0.0.0 Latest Alpha"}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944160-GSOQlE6T6bOgp4sVRfMH","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944160,"model":"google/gemini-4-argon","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://github.com/nodejs/Release?tab=readme-ov-file","title":"nodejs/Release","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"## README\n\n# Node.js Release Working Group\n\n## Release schedule\n\n| Release | Status | Codename |Initial Release | Active LTS Start | Maintenance Start | End-of-life |\n| :--: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| [22.x][] | **Maintenance LTS** | [Jod][] | 2024-04-24 | 2024-10-29 | 2025-10-21 | 2027-04-30 |\n| [24.x][] | **Maintenance LTS** | [Krypton][] | 2025-05-06 | 2025-10-28 | 2026-10-20 | 2028-04-30 |\n| [26.x][] | **Active LTS** | [Lithium][] | 2026-05-05 | 2026-10-28 | 2027-10-20 | 2029-04-30 |\n\n| Release | Status | Codename | Alpha Start | Current Start | LTS Start | End-of-life |\n| :--: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| 27.x | **Alpha** | | 2026-10-28 | 2027-04-22 | 2027-10-20 | 2030-04-30 |\n\nDates are subject to change.\n\n \n\nThe Release schedule is available also as a [JSON][] file.\n\n### Release Phases\n\nThere are four phases that a Node.js release can be in: 'Alpha', 'Current',\n'Active Long Term Support (LTS)', and 'Maintenance'. Starting with Node.js 27,\nevery release line goes through the 'Alpha' phase before its first 'Current'\nrelease, and every release line is promoted to LTS. Those release lines stay in\n'Active LTS' for the whole 30 months of Long Term Support and do not go through\nthe 'Maintenance' phase. See the\n[Evolving the Node.js Release Schedule][] announcement for details.\n\nRelease lines up to and including Node.js 26 follow the previous schedule: they\ndo not go through the 'Alpha' phase, and odd-numbered release lines were not\npromoted to LTS - they did not go through the 'Active LTS' or 'Maintenance'\nphases.\n\n...\n\n* Active LTS - New features, bug fixes, and updates that have been audited by\n the Release team and have been determined to be appropriate and stable for the\n release line."}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

